flowchart LR
    U[用户 / Web] --> API[REST + SSE API]
    API --> CHAIN[取证与解析]
    RPC[Ethereum JSON-RPC / Anvil] --> CHAIN
    CHAIN --> FACTS[TxFacts + 原始 JSON]
    FACTS --> RULES[七条确定性风险规则]
    FACTS --> AGENT[Spring AI Agent / 工具调用]
    RULES --> AGENT
    AGENT --> REPORT[中文结构化报告 + evidence]
    REPORT --> DB[(PostgreSQL 分析历史)]
    REPORT --> U
    FIXTURE[30 条冻结 RPC fixture] --> OFFLINE[Offline 评测]
    OFFLINE --> CHAIN
    OFFLINE --> RULES
    OFFLINE --> GATE[JSON / Markdown 结果 + CI 门槛]
    NOTE[链上事实只来自 RPC；LLM 不得改写事实与规则] -.-> FACTS
